    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Aspect Heroes is a turn-based strategy game with a rich fantasy narrative and a new unique mixture of battle mechanics. Roguelike skill trees and battle progression, procedurally spawning enemies, and a huge cast of both enemies and heroes keep battles fresh and replayable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/a03e0ec522da0b08cac1da4575e4ee43.poster.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/a03e0ec522da0b08cac1da4575e4ee43.webm?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/a03e0ec522da0b08cac1da4575e4ee43.mp4?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/e6ae2a94441787424c6ecccb700606b7.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/2ca93001a16fa92b6bf7dcc25d23c31f.poster.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/2ca93001a16fa92b6bf7dcc25d23c31f.webm?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/2ca93001a16fa92b6bf7dcc25d23c31f.mp4?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/e9ae73d7dd67f67e3932fd8a5cc7020e.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>Notch, the Hunter. Pila, the Legionary. Feurie, the Firemage. Draco, the Flameknight. John, the Smith. Lucian, the Jester[. Tera, the Treespeaker. Lachesis, the Harvester. Vix, the Bloodmage. Blaidd, the Veteran. Unlock more hidden heroes through achievements!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/1b82ce0b705ef53b3b2b22037bd4756f.poster.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/1b82ce0b705ef53b3b2b22037bd4756f.webm?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/1b82ce0b705ef53b3b2b22037bd4756f.mp4?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/d4a58479aa4f5c2021bf4430f5218e86.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>The entire storyline is told from ten different Heroes' perspectives in Story Mode. Uncover secret plots, selfless acts, heartbreaking truths, and bittersweet justice. Will the once peaceful land of Caestice ever be the same?<br><br>Explore 9 hand painted, beautiful environments each with their own twist on the battle mechanics. All the authored scripts are professionally voice acted in a way that brings the story to life as you progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/fdf65c2a7f9cfc495ee9c5573678303b.poster.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/fdf65c2a7f9cfc495ee9c5573678303b.webm?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/fdf65c2a7f9cfc495ee9c5573678303b.mp4?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/e28ec8b3952c2b62427d4a9fa914f4e7.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><br>As you clear each procedural wave of oncoming enemies, choose from stats, summoned allies, or game-changing skill tree options in a roguelike experience. No two battles will be the same! Plan, survive, adapt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/ee96853e5fc96158c1e7679df1a0107a.poster.avif?t=1714004775\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/ee96853e5fc96158c1e7679df1a0107a.webm?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665930/extras/ee96853e5fc96158c1e7679df1a0107a.mp4?t=1714004775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
